{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Generators\/documentation\/Generators","doc:\/\/Sampling\/documentation\/Sampling","doc:\/\/Distributions\/documentation\/Distributions","doc:\/\/SeedDiscovery\/documentation\/SeedDiscovery","doc:\/\/SeedTrees\/documentation\/SeedTrees"],"title":"Modules","anchor":"Modules"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Seeded random numbers whose seeds you can find, write down and hand to someone else."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftPRNG\/documentation\/SwiftPRNG","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","title":"SwiftPRNG","externalID":"SwiftPRNG","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"SwiftPRNG"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftprng"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every type is a value. The generators ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Generators\/documentation\/Generators","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") reproduce bit for bit on every platform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and in every Swift release, and are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":", so a position in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence can be copied, compared, saved and restored. The draws ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sampling\/documentation\/Sampling","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") fix their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithms, where the standard library’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"random(in:using:)"},{"type":"text","text":" promises only a correct distribution."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The distributions ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Distributions\/documentation\/Distributions","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") do the same for normal, exponential, gamma, Poisson and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the rest, down to their logarithms and cosines. A seed tree ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SeedTrees\/documentation\/SeedTrees","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") gives each decision in a program a seed of its own, derived from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path of names and indices, so adding a draw anywhere never shifts the numbers elsewhere. A seed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"search ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SeedDiscovery\/documentation\/SeedDiscovery","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") finds the smallest seed in a range that does what a predicate asks,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequentially or across cores, and a tree fits that seed into one subtree while the rest of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"program stays as it was."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bounds that cannot be sampled trap, like an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Array"},{"type":"text","text":" subscript; the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"checked"},{"type":"text","text":" spellings throw a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typed error instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"import SwiftPRNG","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" imports every module. Each module also has its own documentation and can be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"imported on its own.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftPRNG","","let tree = SeedTree(42)","let fitted = tree.fitting([\"customer\", 7], in: SeedSearch(0 ..< 100_000)) { tree in","    tree[\"customer\", 7, \"arrival\"].uniform(in: 0 ..< 60) < 1","}","fitted?.overriddenSeeds  \/\/ [[\"customer\", 7]: 33]"]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://SwiftPRNG/documentation/SwiftPRNG":{"kind":"symbol","title":"SwiftPRNG","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftPRNG\/documentation\/SwiftPRNG","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Seeded random numbers whose seeds you can find, write down and hand to someone else.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftprng"},"doc://Generators/documentation/Generators":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"Generators","identifier":"doc:\/\/Generators\/documentation\/Generators","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/generators"},"doc://Distributions/documentation/Distributions":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Distributions","identifier":"doc:\/\/Distributions\/documentation\/Distributions","role":"collection","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/distributions"},"doc://Sampling/documentation/Sampling":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"Sampling","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sampling\/documentation\/Sampling","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/sampling"},"doc://SeedDiscovery/documentation/SeedDiscovery":{"kind":"symbol","title":"SeedDiscovery","identifier":"doc:\/\/SeedDiscovery\/documentation\/SeedDiscovery","role":"collection","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/seeddiscovery"},"doc://SeedTrees/documentation/SeedTrees":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"SeedTrees","identifier":"doc:\/\/SeedTrees\/documentation\/SeedTrees","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/seedtrees"}}}